# Ignore everything by default
*

# Track configuration
!.gitignore
!settings.jsonc
!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
# Skills are deny-by-default, same shape as rules below. The previous
# `!skills/**` was fail-open: a work skill symlinked in from 1Password was
# tracked unless someone remembered to deny it by name, and a new skill
# documenting internal infrastructure became committable silently.
