# Rules load as global instructions in every session. Generic ones are tracked
# so they exist on a fresh clone; work-specific ones come from 1Password and are
# symlinked in, so anything not named here stays ignored by default.
!rules/
rules/*
!rules/code-comments.md
!rules/context7.md

# Local plugins (in-repo marketplace; runtime install state lives under plugins/)
